# Your API key and your administrator account are kept outside this folder (in your home folder and in
# /workspaces/.openwebui-class): nothing secret is written here. Exports you download:
*.zip
# On your own computer (dev container), /workspaces cannot be written: the administrator account is
# then kept here, and never committed.
.openwebui-class/
# The live tool's data of the day (today's fire danger), made by the first openwebui start from the image's
# template and filled in by you on the day of a session: your own copy, never committed (a fork's copy would
# give its data to your chatbots; openwebui share open warns if git tracks it).
mcp/fire-danger.json
